-- Orders[OrderID] 1:* Sales[OrderID]; Products[ProductID] 1:* Sales[ProductID]; Sales[SaleID] 1:* Returns[SaleID].
-- For daily measures, use Orders[OrderDate] as the order-date relationship; Returns use Returns[ReturnDate] for return-date analysis.